# Network

Copy this file to `network.md` (gitignored) and fill in your own values.

- **Primary subnet**: 10.0.0.0/24
- **Gateway / firewall**: (hostname, see `devices/<your-firewall>.md`)
- **DNS**: (internal resolver, upstream)
- **DHCP range**: 10.0.0.100 – 10.0.0.200
- **VLANs**: (list any)
- **WAN entry points**: (VPN endpoints, Cloudflare tunnels, port forwards, etc.)

## Public hostnames

| Hostname | Target | Via |
|----------|--------|-----|
